{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_20_1541559733#4_3367593754","relevance":3,"reason":"The document is focused on cultivating humility and directly explains how humility benefits individuals and relationships: humble people handle stress better, report higher physical and mental well-being, show generosity, helpfulness, and gratitude, and gain inner freedom from self-protection.","learned":"Humility can lead to the good life by improving stress coping, physical and mental well-being, generosity, helpfulness, gratitude, closeness to others, and freedom from defensiveness."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3092","reason":"This relationship-focused humility query produced a strong dedicated result with direct mechanisms, so continue to find more similar evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3092"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_49_1608274146#7_3374375765","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3092","rank":4,"snippet":"Disorder 18 Signs Someone Has Narcissistic Personality Disorder Symptoms Causes Diagnosis Final Thoughts Inspiration to your Inbox Share this Image On Your Site Power of Positivity \" , \"segment\": \"Reprimanding NPD sufferers about their problems can provoke more opposition to receiving help. By receiving professional help, NPD patients take steps towards happy, fulfilling lives. The goal is for them to become better people overall, capable of building healthy relationships with others. Building positive self-esteem is key to their ability to build a bright future. However, they must also learn that practicing <cover>humility brings benefits, especially in maintaining positive relationships. </cover>Share this Image On Your Site </p><br /><br /><br /><br /> <p><strong>Please include attribution to https://www.powerofpositivity.com/ with this graphic.</strong></p><br /><br /><br /><br /> <p><a href=’https://www.powerofpositivity.com/narcissistic-personality-disorder/’><img src=’https://cdn.powerofpositivity.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/signs-someone-has-Narcissistic-Personality-Disorder-410×1024.png’ alt=’signs of a Narcissistic Partner infographic’ 540px border=’0′ /></a></p><br /><br /><br /><br /> <p> SHARE PIN IT LEAVE A REPLY Power of Positivity Our passion is to serve and bring the best possible ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_49_1608274146#6_3374374297","rank":3,"relevance":2}]}}
