{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ humility (+ eudaimonia \"good life\") (+ virtue happiness flourishing))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_931315869#12_1792569493","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q3094","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_931315869#12_1792569493\" , \"end_char\": 5567.000000 , \"headings\": \"The Good Life - Bible Study Book The <cover>Good Life - Bible Study Book What Jesus Teaches about Finding True Happiness Sale: $14.99 $14.99 per thing that you specify In Stock About this Item Other Formats Companion Products Title Available Options Quantity Price Media \" , \"segment\": \"• Develop endurance when experiencing persecution. • Practice God-centered humility. • </cover>Become a more merciful person as you extend the mercy of God to others. • Reflect on the timeless truths of the beatitudes. • See how God can use you as a peacemaker in your church and community. Show more Specifications Table Height 0.40 Length 9.50 Width 7.00 Language English Medium Format Paperback Pages 144 Product Group Bible Study Type Study Guide Publication Date 2020-06-01 Publisher Lifeway Christian Resources Item Number 005822306 ISBN10 1535994894 ISBN13 9781535994897 Contributors Derwin Gray (Author) Other Formats eBook, Study Guide $14.99 eBook, Study Guide $14.99 Paperback, Study Guide $14.99 Companion Products Title Available Options Quantity Price Add The "}}
