{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_191292717#4_434518032","relevance":2,"reason":"This is another segment of the Beatitudes/Psalms document directly identifying “poor in spirit” as humility of spirit and linking it to blessedness and the kingdom of heaven, but it remains a broad Beatitudes outline rather than a dedicated explanation of how humility leads to the good life.","learned":"Christian Beatitudes material repeatedly treats humility of spirit as foundational to blessedness, teachability, righteousness, mercy, purity, peacemaking, and the kingdom of heaven."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ humility (+ \"why is humility good\" \"why humility is good\" \"benefits of humility\") (+ well-being relationships stress))","reason":"Search for article-style sources explicitly answering why humility is good and naming concrete good-life benefits such as well-being, relationships, and stress resilience."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ humility (+ \"why is humility good\" \"why humility is good\" \"benefits of humility\") (+ well-being relationships stress))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_740891692#7_1395821313","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3097","rank":2,"snippet":"our Editor-in-Chief You are already subscribed to our newsletter! \" , \"segment\": \"Read also Best discipline quotes to motivate you each morning READ ALSO: Bible study outline on faith Photo: www.bigquestionsonline.com The benefits of humility according to the Bible The Bible gives us at least three important reasons to live a humble life. They are the following: He gives favor to humble. Proverbs 3:34 The reward of humility and the reverent and worshipful fear of the Lord is riches and honor and life. Proverbs 22:4 When pride comes, then comes disgrace, but with the humble is wisdom. Proverbs 11:2 God give us a strength to be a humble person. One could try to imagine how different his life could be without this God’s virtue. It can change everything beginning with marriage, work, education, <cover>relationships with close people, and so on.\" , \"start_char\": 3306.000000 , \"title\": \"Benefits of humility </cover>in life according to the Bible ▷ Legit.ng\" , \"url\": \"https://www.legit.ng/1216482-benefits-humility-life-according-bible.html\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_50_458419413#21_921426618","rank":1,"relevance":1}]}}
