{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_740891692#7_1395821313","relevance":3,"reason":"The document is explicitly dedicated to the benefits of humility in life according to the Bible and directly supports the information need with claims that humility brings divine favor, wisdom, riches, honor, life, and positive change in marriage, work, education, and close relationships.","learned":"A biblical-benefits framing says humility leads to the good life through favor, wisdom, honor, life, and transformed relationships and responsibilities."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3097","reason":"This query is producing documents explicitly about why humility is good and its benefits, so continue to find more grade-3 evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3097"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_740891692#20_1395841890","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3097","rank":4,"snippet":"self-control 4. Better work performance 5. Being more helpful 6. Earning people’s respect 7. Enabling freedom Be the first to get hottest news from our Editor-in-Chief You are already subscribed to our newsletter! \" , \"segment\": \"1. Soothing the soul Humble people are known to cope a little easier with anxiety about mortality. Instead of being afraid of death, humble and kind people are trying to find a useful perspective on life and live it better. Such an approach makes death easier to contemplate. Humility also gives peace of mind. It helps you to stay away from the <cover>stress and pressure of trying to become popular, powerful, and respected by others. Humility can also relieve you from attempts of being more significant. It can make you feel comfortable without lacking self-confidence. 2. Gaining excellence in leadership Humility is a key to excellent leadership.\" , \"start_char\": 8102.000000 , \"title\": \"Benefits of humility </cover>in life according to the Bible ▷ Legit.ng\" , \"url\": \"https://www.legit.ng/1216482-benefits-humility-life-according-bible.html\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_50_458419413#20_921425667","rank":3,"relevance":1}]}}
{"request":{"judgments":"30/50"}}
{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_740891692#20_1395841890","relevance":3,"reason":"This is another segment of an article explicitly dedicated to the benefits of humility in life; it directly explains good-life mechanisms including peace of mind, reduced stress and pressure to be popular or powerful, healthier self-confidence, better perspective on life, and excellence in leadership.","learned":"Humility can lead to the good life by soothing the soul, reducing anxiety and stress, freeing people from status-chasing, supporting peace of mind, and improving leadership."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3097","reason":"The current benefits-of-humility query is yielding directly relevant, dedicated evidence, so continue through more results while it remains productive."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3097"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_20_1541559733#3_3367591944","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3097","rank":5,"snippet":"said, “I claim to be a simple individual liable to err like any other fellow mortal. I own, however, that I have humility enough to confess my errors and to retrace my steps.” If Gandhi is an example of what a humble leader can accomplish, then society serves to benefit from this kind of governance. Consider what researchers of the “quiet ego” —a construct similar to humility—suggest happens when we gain control of our ego: we become less likely to act aggressively, manipulate others, express dishonesty, and destroy resources. Instead, we take responsibility for and correct our mistakes, listen to others’ ideas, and keep our abilities in humble perspective. Who wouldn’t want that kind of leadership for our country—and the world? But the <cover>benefits of humility do not extend to just our leaders. Nascent research suggests that this lovely quality is good for us individually and for our relationships.</cover>\" , \"start_char\": 2265.000000 , \"title\": \"How Humility Will Make You the Greatest Person Ever\" , \"url\": \"https://greatergood.berkeley.edu/article/item/humility_will_make_you_greatest_person_ever\" }"}}
