{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_1476400383#0_2377326644","relevance":3,"reason":"The document is explicitly dedicated to the importance of humility in life and directly supports the need by explaining humility as realistic self-knowledge, respect for others' perspectives, not low self-esteem but thinking of oneself less, and a source of power over oneself.","learned":"Humility supports the good life by giving clear self-perspective, respect for others, freedom from ego-centeredness, and self-mastery rather than low self-esteem."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3103","reason":"The importance-of-humility query produced a directly relevant dedicated article, so continue to find more documents explaining humility's benefits in life, happiness, relationships, and success."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3103"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_1476400383#6_2377335739","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3103","rank":2,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_1476400383#6_2377335739\" , \"end_char\": 4124.000000 , \"headings\": \"The <cover>Importance of Humility in Life</cover>The Importance of Humility in Life The Importance of Humility in Leadership Lessons in Humility Famous Humble Leaders Living By Faith – free eBook \" , \"segment\": \"Humility also helps us overcome conflicts and obstacles in life and thereby create harmonious situations in both our personal and professional lives. The same way arrogance can repel people, humility can bring them closer. Being humble also empowers the people around you. When people are made to feel important, they become capable. They are able to recognize their own power and confidently embrace it in order to become better people in life. According to Lao Tzu, “to lead people, walk behind them”. Famous Humble Leaders To get a clearer understanding of what humility really is, here are some examples. One of the most famous examples of extreme humility, Mother Theresa, gave up her own life and decided to take care of the sick, poor, and the dying. Her work in India inspired many, "}}
